.\" Manual page for docmost-cli-search(1)
.\" Source: SPECIFICATION.md section 4.5, src/docmost_cli/cli/search.py
.TH DOCMOST\-CLI\-SEARCH 1 "2026\-03\-22" "docmost\-cli 0.6.0" "User Commands"
.SH NAME
docmost\-cli\-search \- full\-text search across a Docmost wiki
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B docmost\-cli search query
.I query
.RB [ \-\-space
.IR slug ]
.RB [ \-\-limit
.IR N ]
.RB [ \-\-type
.BR page | attachment ]
.RB [ \-\-json ]
.SH DESCRIPTION
Full\-text search across all pages and attachments in the Docmost
workspace.
Results include a highlighted snippet showing the matching text
in context.
.SH SUBCOMMANDS
.SS query
Execute a full\-text search.
.PP
.I query
is the search string.
.TP
.BI \-\-space " slug"
Restrict search to a specific space.
.TP
.BI \-\-limit " N"
Maximum total number of results across all pages.
When omitted, every page is retrieved.
.TP
.BI \-\-page\-size " N"
Results per request, 1\-100. Default: 100.
.TP
.BI \-\-cursor " cursor"
Fetch a single page of results starting at this cursor.
.TP
.B \-\-no\-follow
Fetch a single page of results instead of following pagination.
.TP
.BI \-\-type " type"
Filter results by type:
.B page
or
.BR attachment .
.TP
.B \-\-json
Output as a JSON array.
Each element is the complete object the server returned, not just the table
columns.
.TP
.BI \-\-fields " a,b,c"
Comma\-separated list of fields to output.
Applies to both
.B \-\-json
and the table, replacing the default columns.
Names are matched against the fields the server returned; an unknown name is a
usage error listing what is available.
.TP
.B \-\-envelope
With
.BR \-\-json ,
include pagination metadata.
.PP
Default table columns: id, title, highlight.
These affect the table only; \-\-json emits every field the server returns.
.SH EXAMPLES
Search across the entire wiki:
.PP
.RS 4
.EX
$ docmost\-cli search query "deployment guide"
.EE
.RE
.PP
Search within a specific space:
.PP
.RS 4
.EX
$ docmost\-cli search query "API endpoint" \-\-space eng
.EE
.RE
.PP
Search for attachments only:
.PP
.RS 4
.EX
$ docmost\-cli search query "diagram" \-\-type attachment
.EE
.RE
.PP
Search and output as JSON:
.PP
.RS 4
.EX
$ docmost\-cli search query "onboarding" \-\-json | jq \(aq.[].title\(aq
.EE
.RE
